BODMAS is a mathematical rule that tells us the correct order to solve a mathematical expression.

~Important points to remember


1.Brackets first.
2.Powers and roots next.
3.Division and multiplication have equal priority (solve left to right).
4.Addition and subtraction have equal priority (solve left to right).

Java interview tip: BODMAS is also useful when solving Java arithmetic expressions. Remember that multiplication and division have equal precedence, as do addition and subtraction.
